  "note": {
    "summary": "The email bears on AAPL. Brightwater Capital Markets is offering one of three remaining seats on a four-person call with a former head of device financing and trade-in programs at a top-three U.S. postpaid carrier. The sender reports she says September-quarter iPhone 18 upgrade rates at two carriers are running roughly 15-20% below plan. The call is set for Thursday 7:30-8:15am ET.",
    "why_attention": "Replying secures a seat in a very small group with a source who, per the sender, is in daily contact with her old team's planning group. She would discuss upgrade rates, trade-in promotions, Pro and Pro Max inventory orders and her expectations for Apple's report on the 29th. Seats are scarce and the sender needs confirmation by 5pm on the day the email was received.",
    "action": "reply",
    "follow_up": "The analyst covering AAPL should reply to the sender by 5pm on 13 October 2026 to confirm a seat, and attend on Thursday at 7:30am ET if it is held. The sender also offers a one-page pre-read.",
    "deadline": "2026-10-13T17:00:00",
    "sections": [
      {"quote": "September-quarter iPhone 18 upgrade rates at her former employer and at one other national carrier are running roughly 15-20% below the internal plan set in July"},
      {"quote": "Thursday 7:30-8:15am ET, four-person group, three seats left."},
      {"quote": "Can you confirm by 5pm today so I can lock the slot?"}
    ]
  }
}
